{section('FIT MATTERS','A useful partnership starts with shared expectations','We are a fit when you are willing to share context, respond to leads and make decisions from evidence. We will tell you if a different specialist or a simpler next step would serve you better.', '<div class="two-col-text"><p>We do not treat every business as a template. A local business with a busy phone line needs different support from a subscription brand testing a new offer. We ask about capacity, margins, ideal customers, geography, the current customer journey and what the team can maintain after launch.</p><p>We can collaborate with your internal staff and existing partners. Clear roles reduce duplicate work and keep customers from receiving conflicting messages. Before work begins, we document what ClearPath will deliver, what you will provide, the approval process, costs and how progress will be reviewed.</p></div>')}
