# About page
about_content=f'''<section class="section"><div class="container narrow prose"><p class="lead">ClearPath is a performance-driven growth agency helping local and online businesses attract, convert and retain customers. We combine paid media, local SEO, conversion-focused websites and lead follow-up with transparent reporting tied to enquiries and revenue, not vanity metrics.</p><h2>Why ClearPath exists</h2><p>Marketing can feel busy without making the business clearer. Teams may be paying for traffic without knowing which leads are suitable. A useful website may sit apart from the campaigns that send people to it. Enquiries may arrive without a reliable follow-up owner. ClearPath brings those parts into one practical plan so a business can see what is happening and choose its next move with confidence.</p><p>Our work is designed to be done-for-you where you need execution and collaborative where your team has expertise to contribute. We keep the plan understandable, show what work is being done and explain what the numbers mean. If the available data is limited, we say so rather than filling the gap with certainty.</p><h2>What guides the work</h2><div class="value-grid"><article><h3>Measurable</h3><p>We define useful measures before work starts and explain the limits of the data.</p></article><article><h3>Done-for-you</h3><p>We take ownership of agreed work and keep your team informed at the right points.</p></article><article><h3>Transparent</h3><p>Scope, costs, access, decisions and results are visible and straightforward.</p></article></div><h2>How we work</h2><p>We learn the business and its constraints, review the current customer journey, build a focused foundation, launch agreed work and improve it through regular review. Each stage has a purpose and an owner. We keep access and approvals clear, respect customer privacy and use only the information needed for the work.</p><h2>What we believe about growth</h2><p>There is no channel that works for every business, and no dashboard can replace a conversation with customers. Strong marketing connects the promise, the customer experience and the follow-up. It creates a path that can be understood, tested and improved. ClearPath aims to make that path visible, so your next investment is based on what you have learned.</p></div></section><section class="section section-cta"><div class="container cta-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow light">MEET CLEARPATH</p><h2>Let’s make your next step clearer.</h2><p>Start with a straightforward review of your current growth path.</p></div><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Get your free growth audit {svg('arrow')}</a></div></section>'''
OUT.joinpath("about").mkdir(exist_ok=True)
OUT.joinpath("about/index.html").write_text(page("About ClearPath | A Transparent Growth Agency","Meet ClearPath, a performance marketing agency built around measurable work, done-for-you support and transparent reporting.","Clear work for meaningful growth.","/about/","About",about_content,"performance marketing agency"),encoding="utf-8")

